<title>POLAND: Polish min T-bill prices flat at primary tender.</title>
<headline>Polish min T-bill prices flat at primary tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills held flat at today's primary auction on total demand of 462 million zlotys against a 1.1 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry sold T-bills worth 117 million at the tender.</p>
<p>It also cut next week's offer by 200 million zlotys to 650 million, it said.  </p>
<p> T-bill		8-week  13-week  26-week  39-week  52-week</p>
